iki/Battle_of_Isefjord\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Battle of Isefjord\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Battle of Isefjord</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"二戰中的芬蘭\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Finland in World War II\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E4%BA%8C%E6%88%B0%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%AC%E8%98%AD&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"二戰中的芬蘭（頁面不存在）\">芬蘭</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finland_in_World_War_II\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Finland in World War II\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Finland in World War II</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span></dt></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%AC%E5%AD%A3%E6%88%98%E4%BA%89\" title=\"冬季戰爭\">冬季戰爭</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E6%88%98%E4%BA%89\" title=\"繼續戰爭\">繼續戰爭</a></li>\n<li>「<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%8A%80%E7%8B%90%E4%BD%9C%E6%88%B0\" title=\"銀狐作戰\">銀狐</a>」</li>\n<li>「<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"演說家行動\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Operation Orator\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%BC%94%E8%AA%AA%E5%AE%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"演說家行動（頁面不存在）\">演說家</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Orator\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Operation Orator\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Operation Orator</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>」</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8B%89%E6%99%AE%E5%85%B0%E6%88%98%E4%BA%89\" title=\"拉普蘭戰爭\">拉普蘭戰爭</a></li>\n<li>「<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E6%96%B9%E5%86%B7%E6%9D%89%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95\" title=\"東方冷杉行動\">東方冷杉</a>」</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%98%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%86%B0%E5%B2%9B\" title=\"第二次世界大戰中的冰島\">冰島</a></dt></dl>\n<ul><li>「<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">餐叉</a>」</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BE%B7%E5%8D%A0%E6%8C%AA%E5%A8%81%E6%97%B6%E6%9C%9F\" title=\"德占挪威時期\">挪威</a></dt></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E7%88%BE%E7%89%B9%E9%A6%AC%E5%85%8B%E8%99%9F%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6\" title=\"阿爾特馬克號事件\">阿爾特馬克號事件</a></li>\n<li>「<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A8%81%E6%82%89%E6%BC%94%E4%B9%A0%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8\" title=\"威悉演習行動\">威瑟</a>」\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BE%B7%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E4%B8%B9%E9%BA%A6\" title=\"德國入侵丹麥\">丹麥</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8C%AA%E5%A8%81%E6%88%B0%E5%BD%B9\" title=\"挪威戰役\">挪威</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>「<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"字母行動\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Operation Alphabet\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%AD%97%E6%AF%8D%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"字母行動（頁面不存在）\">字母</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Alphabet\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Operation Alphabet\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Operation Alphabet</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>」</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A0%B4%E5%A3%9E%E6%8C%AA%E5%A8%81%E5%BE%B7%E8%BB%8D%E9%87%8D%E6%B0%B4%E5%BB%A0\" title=\"破壞挪威德軍重水廠\">重水廠破壞行動</a></li>\n<li>「<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"大劍行動\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Operation Claymore\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=