a-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Operation Fritham\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%BC%97%E5%88%97%E6%BC%A2%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"弗列漢行動（頁面不存在）\">弗列漢</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Fritham\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Operation Fritham\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Operation Fritham</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>」</li>\n<li>「<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"變速箱行動\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Operation Gearbox\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%AE%8A%E9%80%9F%E7%AE%B1%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"變速箱行動（頁面不存在）\">變速箱</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Gearbox\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Operation Gearbox\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Operation Gearbox</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>」</li>\n<li>「<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"變速箱二號行動\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Operation Gearbox II\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%AE%8A%E9%80%9F%E7%AE%B1%E4%BA%8C%E8%99%9F%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"變速箱二號行動（頁面不存在）\">變速箱二號</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Gearbox_II\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Operation Gearbox II\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Operation Gearbox II</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>」</li>\n<li>「<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"領袖行動\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Operation Leader\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A0%98%E8%A2%96%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"領袖行動（頁面不存在）\">領袖</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Leader\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Operation Leader\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Operation Leader</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>」</li>\n<li>「<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"檸檬味行動\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Operation Zitronella\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%AA%B8%E6%AA%AC%E5%91%B3%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"檸檬味行動（頁面不存在）\">檸檬味</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Zitronella\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Operation Zitronella\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Operation Zitronella</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>」</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8F%90%E5%B0%94%E7%9A%AE%E8%8C%A8%E5%8F%B7%E6%88%98%E5%88%97%E8%88%B0#英国对提尔皮茨号的袭击\" title=\"提爾皮茨號戰艦\">襲擊「鐵必制號」</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BD%A9%E5%AF%9F%E8%8E%AB-%E5%B8%8C%E7%88%BE%E5%85%8B%E5%85%A7%E6%96%AF%E6%94%BB%E5%8B%A2\" title=\"佩察莫-希爾克內斯攻勢\">佩察莫-希爾克內斯</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"解放芬馬克\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Liberation of Finnmark\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE%E8%8A%AC%E9%A6%AC%E5%85%8B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"解放芬馬克（頁面不存在）\">芬馬克</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liberation_of_Finnmark\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Liberation of Finnmark\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Liberation of Finnmark</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%98\" title=\"第二次世界大戰\">第二次世界大戰</a>期間，<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%B1%E5%9C%8B\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"英國\">英國</a></b>發起「<b>福克行動</b>」（Operation Fork），<b>進攻並佔領<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%B2%9B\" title=\"冰島\">冰島</a></b>。這次軍事行動由<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%B1%E5%9C%8B%E7%9A%87%E5%AE%B6%E6%B5%B7%E8%BB%8D\" title=\"英國皇家海軍\">英國皇家海軍</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%B1%E5%9C%8B%E7%9A%87%E5%AE%B6%E6%B5%B7%E8%BB%8D%E9%99%B8%E6%88%B0%E9%9A%8A\" title=\"英國皇家海軍陸戰隊\">英國皇家海軍陸戰隊</a>執行。後來加拿大軍隊和美國軍隊接替英國控制冰島。\n</p><p>1940年4月9日，冰島的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%97%E4%B8%BB%E5%9B%BD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"宗主國\">宗主國</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%B9%E9%BA%A5%E7%8E%8B%E5%9C%8B\" title=\"丹麥王國\">丹麥王國</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%B9%E9%BA%A5%E5%8F%97%E4%BD%94%E9%A0%98%E6%99%82%E6%9C%9F\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"丹麥受佔領時期\">被納粹德國占領</a>。為阻止德國佔領冰島，英國在勸說冰島政府加入<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E5%9C%8B_(%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%B0)\" title=\"同盟國 (第二次世界大戰)\">盟軍</a>失敗後，於1940年5月10日上午進攻冰島<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Stone&#95;19982&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Stone_19982-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。7月，加拿大軍隊登陸冰島<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。一年之後，美軍開始駐守冰島。\n</p><p>1944年6月17日，<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%B2%9B%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"冰島共和國\">冰島共和國</a>通過<a href=\"/wiki/1944%E5%B9%B4%E5%86%B0%E5%B2%9B%E5%AE%AA%E6%B3%95%E5%85%AC%E6%8A%95\" title=\"1944年冰島憲法公投\">公投</a>獨立。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考文獻\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8D.BB\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%8B%B1%E5%9C%8B%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E5%86%B0%E5%B3%B6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Stone&#95;19982-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Stone_19982_1-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173179\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{ba